node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.karos-workspace
**/.karos-workspace
docs
# scripts/ is dev-only (demo/smoke-test entrypoints) EXCEPT the build graph,
# which apps/agent-server/Dockerfile's builder stage runs (`npm run build`) —
# excluding it breaks the image build.
#
# EVERY module build-workspaces.mjs imports must be carved out here too. AU54
# split the discovery/topo-sort logic into workspace-graph.mjs and did not add
# the second line, so the builder failed with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND on a file
# that exists in the repo and passes every local check — the build context is
# the one place a split file can go missing. `dockerignore-build-graph.test.ts`
# now derives this list from the actual imports rather than trusting it.
scripts
!scripts/build-workspaces.mjs
!scripts/workspace-graph.mjs
evals
# This also excludes the __tests__-only slide.html fixture (agents/
# instagram-agent/__tests__/fixtures/templates/) — safe now that a real
# default template ships at agents/instagram-agent/assets/templates/default/
# (karoslabs/agent-engine#4), which is NOT under __tests__ and so is NOT
# excluded here.
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
# Root-level docs only — NOT **/*.md, which would also exclude the agents'
# prompts/**/*.md files (the actual runtime prompt content FilePromptStore
# reads from disk).
/*.md
